new=''' * patrons, holds, pool memberships, statements and watchers are dropped. When someone on the other
 * sheet already goes by their name or an alias, they are merged into that person there: their claims
 * listed after the other's own, their name and aliases joined to the other's aliases, and their contact
 * dropped.
 */'''
assert old in s; s=s.replace(old,new)
s=s.replace(''' an alias or their contact is already in use on the other sheet.''',''' when their contact is already in use on the other sheet (unless they are merged there), and when the person
     * they would be merged into is retired.''')
open(p,'w').write(s)
